### 🐛 Describe the bug

The OpenAI API specification specifies that ids of segments in the `segments` section of the `verbose_json` response should be unique. This is not the case for the tested vLLM version.

Running vllm command:
```bash
vllm serve "openai/whisper-tiny"
```

Example request:
```bash
curl -F model="openai/whisper-tiny" -F file="@./VOXTAB_Academic_audio.mp3" http://localhost:8000/v1/audio/transcriptions -F response_format="verbose_json" | jq
```

